## Brand Portfolio

### `BrandPortfolio` — `src/components/BrandPortfolio/`
- **Figma**: "Brand Portfolio" frame — first sub-frame shows all four cards in default state; the next four sub-frames show one of Sonic Automotive / EchoPark / Tactical Fleet / Powersports expanded.
- **Role**: Organism that composes 4 (configurable to N) `BrandShowcaseCard` molecules into a horizontal row with **exactly-one** selection state. Clicking a collapsed card animates the row so the new card grows to 384 px while the other three flex equally to fill the remaining width.
- **Props**:
  - `brands: BrandShowcaseEntry[]` (**required**) — array of card configs; each entry mirrors `BrandShowcaseCard`'s prop surface plus a stable `key` and an optional `ctaLabel` (set to `undefined` to suppress the molecule's default single-CTA when a `#cta-<key>` slot is provided instead)
  - `modelValue?: string | null` (v-model) — currently selected card's `key`. Pass `null` to render the "all collapsed" Figma frame.
  - `selectFirstByDefault?: boolean` (default `true`) — when `modelValue` is `undefined` at mount, initialise selection to `brands[0].key`. Set to `false` (and pass `:modelValue="null"`) for the "Default" / "all collapsed" story.
- **Emits**:
  - `update:modelValue: [string | null]`
  - `select: [key: string]`
  - `cta-click: [{ key: string, event: MouseEvent }]`
- **Slots** (per-brand, dynamic by `brand.key`):
  - `#content-<key>` — replaces `BrandShowcaseCard`'s `#selected-content` slot for the specified brand.
  - `#cta-<key>` (scope: `{ onCtaClick: (event: MouseEvent) => void }`) — replaces `BrandShowcaseCard`'s `#cta` override slot. EchoPark uses this to render a primary + secondary `BaseButton` pair side-by-side.
- **Layout**:
  - **Desktop (≥ 600 px)**: row capped at `max-width: 1286px`, `margin: 0 auto`, no gap between cards. Selected slot is `flex: 0 0 384px`; collapsed slots are `flex: 1 1 0; max-width: 322px`. The molecule's `--bsc-width-collapsed` / `--bsc-width-selected` CSS vars are overridden to `100%`.
  - **Mobile (≤ 599 px)**: row stacks vertically; cards keep their 322 / 384 px widths and centre horizontally. Tap-to-expand still works the same as desktop.
- **Animation**: the row's flex-basis transitions sync with the molecule's `width` transition (both `0.3s ease`)
- **Stories** (`Organisms/BrandPortfolio`): `Default` (all collapsed), `SonicSelected`, `EchoParkSelected` (demonstrates the `#cta-echopark` slot for primary + secondary CTAs), `TacticalFleetSelected` (description-only body), `PowersportsSelected`, `Interactive`
- **Storybook `title`**: `Organisms/BrandPortfolio`

## SRP Filters Panel

### `SrpFiltersPanel` — `src/components/SrpFiltersPanel/`
- **Figma**: "SRP Filters" — sliding parent/child panel; parent list shows filter categories, child panel slides in from right
- **Props**: `categories: FilterCategory[]` (**required**), `modelValue?: string | null` (v-model, active child key or `null` for parent), `hideHeader?: boolean` (default `false`)
- **Type export**: `FilterCategory` — `{ key: string, label: string, hasSelection: boolean, hideTitle?: boolean }`
- **Emits**: `update:modelValue`, `reset`
- **Slot**: `#child="{ activeFilter }"` — parent renders the active child filter component via this slot
- **Behaviour**: Two-pane slide animation (parent slides left, child slides in from right); back button returns to parent list; optional `hideTitle` per category suppresses the built-in child title heading; `hideHeader` suppresses the "Filters / Reset" header (for mobile drawer use)
- **Composes**: `SrpFilterParent`
- **Storybook `title`**: `Organisms/SRP Filters/FiltersPanel`

